  unitName: Ice Legend Selena
  unitId: 20016
  unitNumber: 802
  description: After losing the people she had led onto the battlefield, Selena sought
    to stop the God Army. On her way there, she suffered an assault by a religious
    fanatic witch, though she was able to escape thanks to the sacrifice her close
    friend Lucina had made. Selena attained powers greater than those of the gods
    during this battle, but immediately after a knight appeared before her and spoke.
    Answering that "even so, I will never forgive you," she was struck down by the
    knight while she stared him down. The people who managed to survive after her
    death stopped retaliating and went on to seek a new home.
  summonDesc: I had always wanted to live freely.<br>Hey, tell me something.<br>Do
    you think I led a free life?
  fusionDesc: Within me exists anger,<br>sadness, and happiness...<br>They shall
    all be my power, and my blade.
  evoDesc: People always have others supporting them.<br>If we realize that, we may
    win<br>even against the gods.
  element: 2
  rarity: 6
